sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Operations manager
    participant W as Web client
    participant API as FastAPI service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor H as Department head

    M->>W: open Issues, ranked by reputation risk
    W->>API: GET /issues
    API->>DB: query active issues
    DB-->>API: ranked issue list
    API-->>W: issues + risk + owner
    M->>W: open issue detail side-sheet
    W->>API: GET /issues/{id}
    API->>DB: issue + linked reviews + events
    DB-->>API: evidence snippets + history
    API-->>W: detail view
    M->>W: assign to department head
    W->>API: PATCH /issues/{id}
    API->>DB: update assignee + log event
    H->>W: resolve after fixing the cause
    W->>API: PATCH /issues/{id}/resolve
    API->>DB: set resolved + log event
